# Keep build contexts small and deterministic.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vite
**/.turbo
# Stale tsc -b incremental state would make `tsc -b` skip emitting dist on a
# fresh build context — exclude it so Docker always does a clean compile.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tmp
data/generated/*
data/cache/*
data/map-packages/*
!**/.gitkeep
.git
*.md
vault/
docs/
# Local secrets. The README's setup step is `cp .env.example .env`, and both
# web.Dockerfile and render-worker.Dockerfile `COPY . .` — so without this the
# filled-in file (DB password, API keys) is baked into two published images and
# survives in their layers. The committed template stays in the context.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
